* {{link|la|tabla|||tr=|pos=|g=|id=}} {{qualifier|Vulgar or Late Latin, Appendix Probi}}

===Etymology===
The origin is {{unk|la|title=uncertain}}. Perhaps from {{der|la|ine-pro|*th₂-dʰlom}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*teh₂-||to stand}} (a variety of {{m|ine-pro|*steh₂-}} without [[s-mobile]], whence also Latin {{m|la|sto|stō, stāre|to stand}}) + {{m|ine-pro|*-dʰlom||instrumental suffix}} whence Latin {{m|la|-bula}}. The original meaning would then be “that which stands”, for which see also Latin {{m|la|stabulum}}.

